exports[`renderRequestEmail snapshots > AL once its law is in effect, initial, both 1`] = `
"Subject: Opt-out and deletion request (KR-7K3M9Q)

Hello Acme Marketing Data,

This is about my own personal information. I am the person it describes, and I am asking for myself from my own email address.

Please stop selling or sharing my personal information, and delete the personal information you hold about me.

I live in Alabama. Under the Alabama Personal Data Protection Act (Ala. Act 2026-552 (HB 351)), I have the right to opt out of the sale of my personal information and to have my personal information deleted. I'm asking you to honor that here, as far as that law applies to you.
If you need me to go through a form instead, send me the link and I'll do it myself.

Here is how to find me:
Name: Jordan Q Example
Email: jordan@example.org

Under Ala. Act 2026-552, sec. 5(d)(4), an opt-out of sale does not have to be authenticated. Please do not ask for ID, an account, or a fee to stop selling my data. If you need a detail to find my record, tell me which one.
If you need to check it's really me before deleting, tell me what you need and why, and I'll decide what to send.

Please reply to confirm within 45 days of receiving this email. If you need the extra time the law allows, tell me inside that period and why.

Thanks,
Jordan Q Example
Reference: KR-7K3M9Q
"
`;

