"Subject: Opt-out and deletion request (KR-7K3M9Q)

Hello Acme Marketing Data,

This is about my own personal information. I am the person it describes, and I am asking for myself from my own email address.

Please stop selling or sharing my personal information, and delete the personal information you hold about me.

I live in Iowa. Under the Iowa Consumer Data Protection Act (Iowa Code ch. 715D), I have the right to opt out of the sale of my personal information. I'm asking you to honor that here, as far as that law applies to you.
That law does not cover everything I'm asking for, so for the rest I'm asking you to honor your own published privacy commitments.
If you need me to go through a form instead, send me the link and I'll do it myself.

Here is how to find me:
Name: Jordan Q Example
Email: jordan@example.org

Please do not ask for ID, an account, or a fee to stop selling my data.
If you need to check it's really me before deleting, tell me what you need and why, and I'll decide what to send.

Please reply to confirm within 90 days of receiving this email. If you need the extra time the law allows, tell me inside that period and why.

Thanks,
Jordan Q Example
Reference: KR-7K3M9Q
"
`;

